**9.1.7**

\(J_{\nu}(z){\,\sim}({\frac{1}{2}}z)^{\nu}/\Gamma(\nu{+}1)\) **(**\(\nu{\,\neq}-1\)**,** \(-2\)**,** \(-3\)**,** \(\cdot\)**,** \(\cdot\)**)**

